    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to 106 Tall Timber Court, a beautifully updated 5-bedroom, 5-bath WaterColor home with a private carriage house, located on a quiet, tree-lined street in one of the most desirable areas of the community.<br><br>Situated on a large corner lot beside a spacious grassy area, this home is perfect for families. Kids can play just steps away while adults relax on the welcoming front porch and enjoy the peaceful surroundings. You’ll have the privacy of a quiet street while still being minutes from the beach, pools, trails, and WaterColor Town Center.<br><br>This home has been completely refreshed and professionally furnished throughout, offering a luxurious yet comfortable space designed for unforgettable beach vacations.<br><br>Brand New Updates & Features<br><br>• All new bedroom and living room furniture throughout the home<br>• Brand new luxury mattresses and premium linens in every bedroom<br>• Beautiful upscale furnishings and décor throughout<br>• Fresh interior paint for a bright and updated feel<br>• New polywood outdoor furniture perfect for relaxing outside<br>• Brand new Samsung washer & dryer<br>• EZ-Go 6-seater golf cart included for exploring WaterColor<br>• 4 adult bikes available year-round (professionally serviced before every stay by La Dolce Vita)<br><br>Guests will also receive wristbands with full access to all WaterColor amenities, including community pools, beach club access, nature trails, and more.<br><br>Home Layout<br>Main Level<br><br>Bedroom 1 – King Master Suite<br>Private ensuite bathroom<br><br>Bedroom 2 – Twin-over-Twin Bunk Room<br>Perfect for kids<br><br>Full Hall Bathroom<br><br>Second Floor<br><br>Bedroom 3 – King Bedroom + Twin-over-Twin Bunks<br>Great option for families traveling together<br><br>Full Hall Bathroom<br><br>Bedroom 4 – Queen Bedroom<br>Private ensuite bathroom<br><br>Private Carriage House<br><br>Perfect for grandparents, couples, or guests wanting additional privacy.<br><br>Carriage House Bedroom 5 – King Suite<br>Large private ensuite bathroom<br><br>Includes:<br>• Kitchenette<br>• Keurig coffee maker<br>• Mini fridge<br><br>The Perfect WaterColor Getaway<br><br>Whether you're spending long beach days, biking scenic trails, enjoying family dinners, or relaxing on the porch with morning coffee, this thoughtfully designed home provides everything you need for a relaxing and memorable stay.<br><br>Experienced Hosts<br><br>While 106 Tall Timber Court is new to the rental market, we are experienced WaterColor hosts. We’ve owned another home just around the corner since 2020 and have welcomed many wonderful guests over the years.<br><br>Feel free to read our guest reviews here:<br>www.vrbo.com/2000154<br><br>We would love to host your next WaterColor beach vacation. If you have any questions about the home or the area, please don’t hesitate to reach out.<br><br>We can’t wait to welcome you!<br><br>Nicole",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
